License: MIT; see toml-c.LICENSE

The vendored header is built directly into tcpcc. Runtime operation and normal
builds do not require libtoml, network access, or the source repository to be
available. The fork is the preferred update/audit source; the original upstream
is retained here for provenance. Update this file whenever the vendored commit
changes.
